    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46954" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sup-pingo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subp-</span></b> ), no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, pactum, 3, v. a.
			pango, <i>to fasten underneath</i>, <i>to clout</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulmentas soccis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 3, 2, 94</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calcar alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Symm. Ep. 1, 62</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui auro habeat soccis suppactum solum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Bacch. 2, 3, 98</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crepidas aureis clavis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 3, 14, § 50</span></i>
			 (dub.; al. suffigo).</div>
